  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/AISSEE/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Bihar School Examination Board, Patna (BSEB)</a></span> has released the admit card for the BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed, Examination for Admission In Diploma In Elementary Education (D.El.Ed) For Two Years Course Program For Session 2026-28. Applications for the BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 11 December 2025, to 24 January 2026. The written examination is going to be conducted on 08-22 June 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed Admit Card 2026-28 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar School Examination Board, Patna (BSEB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed 2026 Admissions : Short Details of Notification</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>11 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>11 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>24 January 2026 (Extend)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>24 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1st Dummy Admit Card Available : <strong>28 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1st Dummy Admit Card Correction : <strong>28 January to 02 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2nd Dummy Admit Card Available : <strong>05 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2nd Dummy Admit Card Correction : <strong>05-10 February 2026</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :<strong> 08-22 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>28 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result Available : <strong>March 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, BC, EBC <strong>: Rs. 960/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, Divyang <strong>: Rs. 760/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed 2026 Notification : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>17 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed Admission Online Form Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed Exam 2026 : Admission Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong>: Diploma in Elementary Education, D.El.Ed (Face To Face Course) Admission For Year 2026-28.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their Intermediate Level (Class 12th) Level of Examination with 50% marks (General) &amp; 45% marks (SC / ST) from any recognized board will be eligible for this Diploma Elementary Education Programme.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed Admission 2026 : Mode Of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Selection will be based on Online / Written Entrance Examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download BSEB Bihar D.El.Ed Admit Card 2026-28</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download the Bihar BSEB DELED Admit Card candidates need to go to the link provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their Bihar BSEB DELED Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will find the Exam Schedule Page displaying their Exam Date, Timing &amp; Paper Code.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For Downloading their Admit Card: Candidates will be redirected to the Login Page here they have provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration Number</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Click in the ‘Login’ Icon.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their Bihar BSEB DELED Admit Card from official site of the BSEB.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<